<title>UK: EMI sees full yr profit of 380-400 mln stg.</title>
<headline>EMI sees full yr profit of 380-400 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMI Group Plc expects its pre-tax, pre-exceptional profit for the year ending March 1997 to total between 380-400 million pounds, finance director Simon Duffy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The range of forecasts is between 380 to 400 million and we would expect to be in that range,&quot; Duffy told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said that EMI should achieve that figure despite a 25 million pound hit caused by currency factors.</p>
</text>
